  "prompt": "What is the MIDLINE of $y = \\sin(x) + 7$? Give the $y$-value.",
  "answerType": "numeric",
  "primaryAnswer": "7",
  "alternativeAnswers": [],
  "acceptanceMode": "normalized",
  "hint": "The midline is set by the number ADDED at the end.",
  "hints": [
    {
      "level": "nudge",
      "text": "The midline is set by the number ADDED at the end."
    },
    {
      "level": "guide",
      "text": "In $y = a\\sin(x) + k$, the midline is $y = k$."
    },
    {
      "level": "reveal",
      "text": "The midline is $y = 7$."
    }
  ],
  "explanation": [
    "Plain $\\sin(x)$ wiggles around $y = 0$.",
    "Adding $7$ lifts every single point of the wave up by $7$, so the whole wave now wiggles around $y = 7$.",
    "The midline is $y = 7$."
  ],
  "alternativeExplanations": [
    {
      "title": "Average the peak and the trough",
      "steps": [
        "sin(x) + 7 rises to 8 at its peak and falls to 6 at its trough.",
        "The middle is the average: (8 + 6) ÷ 2 = 7."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The heartbeat-monitor picture",
      "steps": [
        "On a heart monitor there is a flat resting line, and the trace bounces above and below it.",
        "The + 7 tells you where that resting line sits: 7 units up."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    "midline"
  ],
